<title>MEXICO: President of Dominican Republic to visit Mexico.</title>
<headline>President of Dominican Republic to visit Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominican Republic President Leonel Fernandez will pay a state visit to Mexico from August 17 to 20 to strengthen ties between the two nations, the Mexican Ministry of Foreign Affairs said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The two government will sign accords dealing with various topics including fighting drug trafficking, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7902))</p>
